Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:26:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 77/77] gl: blend elision, target precreation and allocation
 checks, warm-up check, alpha-test census, vitaGL hooks

Draws whose blend provably yields the source colour are drawn with blending off (gl_blend_elide, exact rule in gl_blend_elide.hpp, brute-force tested); FXAA's second texture is made with the display target and a failed target allocation is logged and skipped; the end of the warm-up reports programs that were not in the shader cache and links during play are counted; a census counts alpha-tested draws that come before opaque draws over the same area; platform hooks for vitaGL patches 0005-0007.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
